  "comments": "According to Las chen, he had a wish to sustain instructions related to Uttaratantra (ID:3749), but Tsong kha pa advised him: \"Listen to teachings on tshad ma!\" (tshad ma nyon). So he went to gSang phu and studied epistemology with Slob dpon dKon seng pa (ID:7350) ([BKUHJCNA]: 711).\r\n\r\n\r\nAccording to Las chen, he is also renowned as Shug 'brum pa due to subsisting only on shug 'brum (juniper seeds?) for three years ([BKUHJCNA]: 714).",
